WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:03.441
Open Status of Health (/health) as an Administrator and click Lights & Sound on Lane01 to open the WebRelay-Quad control dialog.

2
00:00:03.481 --> 00:00:10.030
Test ControlByWeb HTTP/XML connectivity (198.51.100.21), enable AUTO EML gatekeeping, and save to arm R1=1 and R2=1 intercept coils.

3
00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:14.740
Fire timed commissioning pulses on Gamma Red Light + Siren (R3) and Neutron Blue Light (R4), then re-arm AUTO intercept.

4
00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:20.527
Confirm WebRelay (AUTO) · Online on Status of Health, and open Guided Walkthrough anytime for a safe read-only refresher and :8444 auto-shutdown info.
